\title{SIV: Separable Instrumental Variable Methods}
\description{
Implements the nonparametric separable instrumental variable estimator of the
average treatment effect on the treated (ATT) under a logit-separable binary
treatment choice model, together with faithful implementations of the
competing estimators from the literature that assume the same separable
treatment/selection mechanism.
}
